  71           * @brief  WDT initialization configuration function
  72           * @param   OverflowTime:WDT overflow time selection
  73           *          - WDT_OverflowTime_500MS: Settings  500MS
  74           *          - WDT_OverflowTime_250MS: Settings 250MS
  75           *          - WDT_OverflowTime_125MS: Settings 125MS
  76           *          - WDT_OverflowTime_62_5MS:Settings 62.5MS
